<title>SWITZERLAND: GM, Suzuki plan small car project.</title>
<headline>GM, Suzuki plan small car project.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors International Operations, a unit of General Motors Corp, and Suzuki Motor Corp are exploring possible cooperation in the small car segment in Europe, GM International said.</p>
</text>
